Package: rapidcodeR
Title: Optimized Data Analysis System for AI-Based Text Processing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gabriel", "Lönn", , "gablon@prio.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Sebastian", "Schutte", , role = "ctb", comment = "Original code and package idea provided by.")
    )
Description: A high-performance R package for extracting machine-readable variables 
    from natural language text using AI APIs. Optimized for speed and cost efficiency 
    through parallel processing and direct CSV-formatted responses from language models. 
    Supports services from multiple AI providers with robust error handling and 
    automatic retry mechanisms for failed extractions. 
